      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif cyning mannes ham drincæþ ⁊ ðær man lyswæs hwæt gedo, twibote gebete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the king drinks at a person’s home, and a person should do anything seriously dishonest there, let him pay two[-fold] restitution.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif cyning æt mannes ham drincæþ, ⁊ ðær man lyswæs hwæt gedo, twibote gebete.</ab>
